# "Sacrifice it. When you do, ..." (CR 603.12): with Villainous Syndication's fourth-plan-counter trigger on the stack,
# Bot2 destroys it with Disenchant. The trigger resolves with nothing to sacrifice (CR 701.21a), so the reflexive ability
# never triggers and the Llanowar Elves Bot1 milled stay in its graveyard.

